module

public import ArtGallery.Hardness.BP.MainArea

/-!
# Boundary-point variant: the bottom wall agrees with reference vertex lists

The bottom wall `bottomWallBP n Φ` reproduces the bottom-wall vertex list computed by
an independent exact-arithmetic implementation of the construction (not included in this repository) (the vertices from `w_l` up to, excluding, `w_r`) on four
instances — kernel-checked equalities of the codes `(num x, den x, num y, den y)`:

* `n = 1`, no constraint; `n = 1`, `x₀ = 1`;
* `n = 3`, `x₀ + x₁ = x₂`, `x₀ x₁ = 1`, `x₁ = 1` (a test instance);
* `n = 2`, `x₁ = 1`, `x₀ = 1`, `x₁ + x₀ = x₁` (two slots with `one` spikes).
-/

@[expose] public section

namespace ArtGallery.BP

